<title>USA: Graco says to defend against patent suit.</title>
<headline>Graco says to defend against patent suit.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Graco Inc said Thursday that it intends to defend itself in a patent infringement lawsuit filed against it by Nordson Corp.</p>
<p>Nordson said Wednesday it filed suit against Graco alleging infringement of its Pro-Flo dispensing systems.</p>
<p>&quot;We have examined the issues surrounding the alleged infringement, and we believe that the PrecisionFlo product does not infringe Nordson's patent,&quot; said Robert Mattison, Graco's vice president and general counsel. &quot;We are confident that Graco will not be prohibited from selling the product or held liable for damages.&quot;</p>
<p>Graco added that its PrecisionFlo product constitutes a &quot;very small portion&quot; of its overall sales and net earnings.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
